   "title": "阿倍野区の盆踊り",
   "html": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">→<a href=\"https://www.city.osaka.lg.jp/abeno/page/0000595062.html#0807\">阿倍野区役所及び阿倍野区各地域の主な催し</a></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"472\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://uemachiweb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/fuminosato.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-15298\" srcset=\"https://uemachiweb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/fuminosato.jpg 472w, https://uemachiweb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/fuminosato-350x500.jpg 350w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 472px) 100vw, 472px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"425\" height=\"628\" src=\"https://uemachiweb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/tokiwa-bon.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-15294\" srcset=\"https://uemachiweb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/tokiwa-bon.jpg 425w, https://uemachiweb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/tokiwa-bon-338x500.jpg 338w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 425px) 100vw, 425px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">常盤地域　ときわ盆踊り大会</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">日時…8月9日（日曜日）<br>場所…文の里中学校<br>問合せ先…常盤地域活動協議会（<a href=\"https://www.mapnavi.city.osaka.lg.jp/osakacity/Map?mid=1&amp;mps=5000&amp;mpy=34.642803&amp;mpx=135.520434&amp;mtl=1004&amp;fid=1216-1004\">〒545-0053大阪市阿倍野区松崎町1-2-50&nbsp;常盤西会館</a>　電話：<a href=\"tel:0666212951\">06-6621-2951</a>）</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">晴明丘地域　納涼盆おどり大会</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">日時…8月15日（土曜日）17時～21時　予定<br>場所…晴明丘会館、晴明丘中央公園及び晴明丘中央公園付属グラウンド<br>問合せ先…晴明丘地域活動協議会（<a href=\"https://www.mapnavi.city.osaka.lg.jp/osakacity/Map?mid=1&amp;mps=5000&amp;mpy=34.626154&amp;mpx=135.505832&amp;mtl=1004&amp;fid=1624-1004\">〒545-0035大阪市阿倍野区北畠1-18-4&nbsp;晴明丘会館</a>　電話：<a href=\"tel:0666294331\">06-6629-4331</a>）</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
  }
 ]
